# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# co-canvas — environment template
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values.
#   cp .env.example .env
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Prisma datasource URL.
# SQLite (default, dev): file path relative to the project root.
DATABASE_URL="file:./db/custom.db"

# PostgreSQL (optional, prod):
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/cocanvas?schema=public"

# Node runtime mode.
NODE_ENV="development"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LLM provider
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# When running inside the z.ai sandbox, `z-ai-web-dev-sdk` auto-resolves
# credentials — no API key needed. To run outside the sandbox, set the
# following (uncomment the one you want to use):
#
# ZAI_API_KEY="your_zai_api_key_here"
# OPENAI_API_KEY="your_openai_api_key_here"
#
# To swap the LLM driver from z-ai back to the native Pi Agent SDK,
# see src/lib/agent/runner.ts and AGENTS.md ("LLM shim policy").
